{"id":"f536090b60665362","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch.md","title":"SLD存在成功答案也可有无限分支","display":"ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch — SLD存在成功答案也可有无限分支","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch","aliases":["72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch"],"display":"ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch — SLD存在成功答案也可有无限分支","depends_on":["[[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §5 and Ch.I resolution search; complete local operational example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch — SLD存在成功答案也可有无限分支"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98e2eaadb15620c0\" href=\"?note=98e2eaadb15620c0\" title=\"72-df-sld-refutation-answer\">72-df-sld-refutation-answer</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §5 and Ch.I resolution search; complete local operational example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(p\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span> 元数为1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:=\\langle p(c)\\rangle\">\\(G:=\\langle p(c)\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:=\\{\\langle p(x),\\langle p(x)\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle p(c),\\langle\\rangle\\rangle\\}\">\\(P:=\\{\\langle p(x),\\langle p(x)\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle p(c),\\langle\\rangle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x):=c\">\\(\\theta(x):=c\\)</span>，其他变量在θ下保持不动；ε是恒等代入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\theta,G),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\varepsilon,\\langle\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\theta,G),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\varepsilon,\\langle\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\vec G\\in(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega\\quad\n\\vec G(0)=G\\ \\land\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\\n(\\vec G(n)=G\\land\\mathsf{SLD}_P(\\vec G(n),\\theta,\\vec G(n+1))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\vec G\\in(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega\\quad\n\\vec G(0)=G\\ \\land\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\\n(\\vec G(n)=G\\land\\mathsf{SLD}_P(\\vec G(n),\\theta,\\vec G(n+1))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>循环子句的变量x与ground goal不交；恒等改名可用，统一p(c)、p(x)的MGU为θ，新的goal仍是G。重复选择这条子句得到常值无限goal序列。若选择事实，则空方程组的MGU为ε，一步到空goal，答案限制到原goal的空变量集仍为ε。这给分支存在的差别，未将一个无限分支误称整个搜索空间没有成功反驳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sld-refutation-answer","status":"resolved","id":"98e2eaadb15620c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"G:=\\langle p(c)\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"P:=\\{\\langle p(x),\\langle p(x)\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle p(c),\\langle\\rangle\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(x):=c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\theta,G),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SLD}_P(G,\\varepsilon,\\langle\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\varepsilon).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\vec G\\in(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma^{<\\omega})^\\omega\\quad\n\\vec G(0)=G\\ \\land\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\\n(\\vec G(n)=G\\land\\mathsf{SLD}_P(\\vec G(n),\\theta,\\vec G(n+1))).","display":true}],"bytes":1791,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-chec